  <h2 class="section-label mb-6">Experience</h2>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <article class="panel">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Peace Nepal DOT Com (PNDC)</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Present</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        Banking platforms: NMB Bank's CMS-driven website and drag-and-drop page builder; Shine
        Resunga Development Bank's online demat (KYC) application.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Sponsorvista</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Dec 2025 – Present</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        Lead full-stack engineer — delivery, deployments, and engineering standards for a
        distributed remote team.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Hourmarket</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Oct 2024 – Oct 2025</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        Page builder, React Native iOS/Android shopping app, .NET → NestJS migration, unified auth.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Braimy</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Jun – Sep 2024</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        Frontend architecture and component system for core user journeys.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Basework.io</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Jan – May 2024</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        AI products and digital banking onboarding for a Nepali bank.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel">
