        <h3 class="font-semibold">Lanceme Up</h3>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">Jul 2022 – Dec 2023</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
        Frontend developer — real-time collaboration, file manager, internal email client, CI/CD on
        AWS & Azure.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Technologies -->
<section class="mb-10 border-t border-dark-border pt-8">
  <h2 class="section-label mb-2">Technologies I've shipped</h2>
  <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-6">Not a wishlist — tools used in real products and systems work.</p>
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
    <div class="panel">
      <p class="text-blue-400 font-mono text-xs mb-2">Frontend &amp; mobile</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">
        React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, React Native (Hourmarket app + music player), jQuery
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <p class="text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs mb-2">Backend</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">Node.js, NestJS, Express, REST APIs, PostgreSQL, Redis</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <p class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs mb-2">Infrastructure</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">AWS, Azure, Docker, GitHub Actions, CI/CD</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <p class="text-purple-400 font-mono text-xs mb-2">Systems</p>
      <p class="text-text-muted">Rust, networking, OS primitives, local-first caching, P2P</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How I work -->
<section class="mb-10 border-t border-dark-border pt-8">
  <h2 class="section-label mb-6">How I work</h2>
  <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-muted">
    <li class="check-item">Written design notes before large changes</li>
    <li class="check-item">Small PRs, ownership through deploy</li>
    <li class="check-item">Async-first communication with clear handoffs</li>
    <li class="check-item">Timezone overlap stated up front for remote teams</li>
    <li class="check-item">
      Regulated-environment habits: UAT sign-off, change control, no client data in public write-ups
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- Connect -->
<section id="contact" class="border-t border-dark-border pt-8">
  <h2 class="section-label mb-4">Connect</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-4">
    Hiring for a remote product, platform, or fintech role? Email is the fastest path.
  </p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
    <a href={mailto} class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">{SITE.email}</a>
    <a
      href={LINKS.github}
      class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/proniraj</a
    >
    <a
      href={LINKS.linkedin}
      class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a
    >
    <a
      href={LINKS.resume}
      class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">Resume (PDF)</a
    >
  </div>
  <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-mono text-text-muted">
    Currently {PROOF.current} · Shipped for {PROOF.clients.join(" · ")}
  </p>
</section>
